  offerLine: Four good digs, and the map comes with us. It's right under here. Or here. I'll know it when I smell it.
  activeLine: It's close! Take me foraging again! Bring the map!
  readyLine: FOUND IT. It's a box! It's full of lights! There's a lantern! I don't know who buried this, but they had lovely taste, and they can't have it back.
  doneLine: I'm keeping the box.
